@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041

### ================== AUTH SETUP ==================
### Login Customer (Rizal - UserId 2 / Wallet W001)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rizallkadamong@gmail.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### Login Admin (Admin - UserId 1)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ewallet.com",
  "password": "AdminEwallet@123"
}

### ================== USER PROFILE (CUSTOMER & ADMIN) ==================
### Get My Profile (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Update My Profile (Customer)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "userName": "rizal.kadamong",
  "fullName": "Rizal Kadamong",
  "email": "rizallkadamong@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "082347711639"
}

### ================== CUSTOMER HISTORY (Policy: CanTransact) ==================
### Get My Transaction History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/transactions?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Get My Wallet Mutation History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/mutations?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ================== ADMIN USER MANAGEMENT (Policy: CanManageUsers) ==================
### Get All Users (Search, Filter & Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?search=&status=&role=&page=2&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Get User Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/3
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Update User Status (ACTIVE / SUSPENDED -> tercatat di AuditLogs)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/3/status
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED",
  "reason": "Akun diaktifkan kembali setelah verifikasi."
}

### ================== PAYMENT METHODS ==================
### Get All Payment Methods (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payment-methods?isActive=
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ================== TOP UP REQUESTS (ADMIN ONLY) ==================
### Get All Top Up Requests (Policy: CanManageUsers)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/topup-requests
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ================== WALLETS & TOP UP (CUSTOMER ONLY) ==================
### Get My Wallet (Berdasarkan JWT Sub)
# @name myWallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lookup Recipient Wallet Sebelum Transfer (Contoh: W002 milik Budi Santoso)
# @name recipientWallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/lookup/W003
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Create Top Up Request (Status PENDING, saldo belum bertambah)
# @name requestTopUp
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me/topup
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "paymentMethodId": 1,
  "amount": 50000
}

### Confirm Top Up (Simulasi pembayaran -> status PAID & saldo bertambah)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/topup/{{requestTopUp.response.body.$.topUpRequestId}}/confirm
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ================== TRANSFER (CUSTOMER ONLY) ==================
### Transfer Balance (Menggunakan ID wallet pengirim & penerima hasil lookup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "senderWalletId": {{myWallet.response.body.$.id}},
  "receiverWalletId": {{recipientWallet.response.body.$.walletId}},
  "amount": 25000,
  "description": "Transfer pengujian Weekly 7"
}


### ================== QA SECURITY & RBAC NEGATIVE TESTS ==================
### [Harus 401 Unauthorized] Akses Wallet tanpa JWT Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Accept: application/json

### [Harus 403 Forbidden] CUSTOMER mencoba mengakses daftar user milik ADMIN
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### [Harus 403 Forbidden] ADMIN mencoba mengakses wallet/transaksi milik CUSTOMER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### [Harus 403 Forbidden] CUSTOMER mencoba transfer memakai SenderWalletId milik orang lain
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transfers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "senderWalletId": 8,
  "receiverWalletId": 7,
  "amount": 10000,
  "description": "Percobaan akses wallet milik user lain"
}